{"steam_appid":1677110,"steam_name":"Lightyear Frontier","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1677110/1523099466/f03be449a84fa963a231934ea90066fbf61e4354/1772527575/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772706155","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297103/81a15be8c1c8fc334811e8aaec57a3c30a772baa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772706155","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/8eb7dbc53866c03a0c1709e71e9ac466a2663de3/ss_8eb7dbc53866c03a0c1709e71e9ac466a2663de3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772726470","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/bc24e07f9e6d0eba88b2e098d18fcdb6362686fc/ss_bc24e07f9e6d0eba88b2e098d18fcdb6362686fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772726470","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/7873dcd829d686882b64ea536e9d934b9706e234/ss_7873dcd829d686882b64ea536e9d934b9706e234.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772726470","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/72865c46ea81f9a5e06415262178453014af202e/ss_72865c46ea81f9a5e06415262178453014af202e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772726470","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/0c0989e5da8ea49d7f000dcbc904b45ef734e66d/ss_0c0989e5da8ea49d7f000dcbc904b45ef734e66d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1772726470"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle your interstellar homestead in this open-world mech farming adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your farm, customize your mech, grow alien crops, and explore a vast new world full of promise with up to three friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/69125bcc76dc66673db32c5a1d491876.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/effa4d1105464c6b6d71eaea444baf75.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm, build, and explore in a customizable mech! Craft new parts and mod chips to tweak your mech's performance to your specifications. Choose from an array of options to build your trusty all-purpose vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/b214e053b200e056aedd528cf1d5989a.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/e19c965f287adb34a78e110e7df88caf.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle on a verdant exoplanet in the Lightyear Frontier, a cluster of habitable worlds in the far reaches of the galaxy. Overcome its environmental challenges in order to thrive on your new home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/48ae1d0a748859423c09b1a94b1a0ab5.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3541e541ba8212ce64eff20c9e7edc84.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take farming to a new level with the power of the mech. Use its mighty tools to plant, water, and harvest vast fields of alien crops with ease. Mastering crop rotation is key to optimize your yield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ec9b015e8cc92f2636813d1b03bf2be3.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/03f02d47525da5797319462e825760e4.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the exofarm of your dreams! Make your mark on the world as you build your homestead piece by piece into a handcrafted retro-futuristic farm. Make your place your own with alternative color palettes and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ccc3b965677294432d6914e2a900dbea.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/3acfd6cca39ffabf5933ba1491814a17.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send resources to remote colonies, befriend interplanetary neighbors, and build a stable of alien livestock. Use the bounty of your harvest to benefit those around you and create a better tomorrow.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/13e5619790b19ad53f01966485b364b3.webp?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.poster.avif?t=1772726470\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.webm?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677110/extras/ae39a78ece1b0494757120a6300f5096.mp4?t=1772726470\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your mech can handle anything the world throws at you, feel free to invite up to three friends to join you on this journey of settling and exploration! Pool your resources to create the perfect homestead, and share the rewarding feeling of a good harvest with your pals!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low settings, 720p, 30 fps</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 6600 / NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1660 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD Recommended - (High settings, 1080p, 60fps)</li></ul>","genres":["Early Access"],"developers":["FRAME BREAK"],"publishers":["FRAME BREAK","Coffee Stain Publishing"],"release_date":"19 Mar, 2024"}